    <string name="about_body">Version %1$s\nMade by Soorya S V\nMaintainer: Vaixus Technologies\n\nA small offline editor for .md, .txt, .yml/.yaml, .py, .html, .json files and PDF viewer.\n\nPrivacy: the app has no network permission, no analytics and no accounts. Files are read and written only through the Android file picker you use. A draft backup of unsaved text is kept in this app\'s private storage and removed when you save or discard.\n\nLimits: UTF-8 files up to %2$d MiB, 10 tabs.\n\nPerformance on this device (milliseconds):\n%3$s</string>

